          "title": "Casket",
          "subtitle": "Patience",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Casket is a moderately easy two-deck solitaire with eight tableau piles forming the casket and foundations above it."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Casket is a two-pack patience game named for its central tableau layout, with a casket of piles and auxiliary cards that feed foundation building."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "Setup",
          "subtitle": "Table, deck, equipment, and deal",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "1 players use the table arrangement described for Casket."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Two standard 52-card decks"
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Two standard 52-card decks, score area, and enough table space for play."
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "text": "Lay out eight tableau piles in the centre as the casket, with additional cards above and foundations available for building."
            }
